      "problem": "If the equation ${log}_{2}⁡(128)=7$ is equivalent to ${b}^{7}=128,$  then $b=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "The logarithm of $a$ with base $b$ is defined as follows:\n\n${log}_{b}⁡a=x$ is equivalent to $a={b}^{x}$\n\nIf we compare ${log}_{2}⁡(128)=7$ with ${log}_{b}⁡a=x,$ we get $a=128,$ $b=2,$ and $x=7.$\n\nTherefore, the given equation is equivalent to ${2}^{7}=128.$ Consequently,  $b=2.$",
